      "content": "i know, i know, but my doctor is super hard to get a hold of and i really dont want to pay for another co-pay just for a quick question. i've taken this exact dose before and it worked fine. i just wanna know if there's any specific reason why it would be bad for my kidneys specifically or if i can just finish the pack to see if it helps? i'm pretty sure my kidney function is stable for now.",
